\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces Per-layer $\times $ \{last-token, mean-pool\} LR probe LOO accuracy on Llama 3.2 3B Instruct equalized-transcript first responses ($n=100$). Last-token curve peaks at layer 12 (67\%); mean-pool peaks at layer 13 (62\%). Shaded bands are Wilson 95\% CIs per layer. Dashed horizontal line is the refusal-count rule (61\%); dotted line is chance (50\%).}}{19}{figure.caption.45}\protected@file@percent }
